                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 2.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Commander Queen to
                        Mr. Robeson, Secretary of the
                    Navy</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Steamer
                            Tuscarora</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Key West,
                        Florida</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1869-10-07"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">October</hi> 7, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><seg type="margin">[177]</seg> *<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Hon. Geo. M. Robeson</hi>:</p>
                <p>Telegram received. No vessel to send. Tuscarora and Saugus only vessels here.
                    Tuscarora cannot move before Monday on account of bursting of main
                    steam-pipe.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. W. QUEEN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Commander and Senior
                            Officer.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
